\cf2\b Beta\cf0\b0  Function \par
Returns Beta(X,Y) using a Series Expansion for 1/Gamma (X) as defined in Abramowitz & Stegun.\par
\par
\cf3\b Declaration\cf0\b0\par
Function \b Beta\b0 (const \b X, Y\b0 : Extended): Extended;\par
\par
\cf3\b Description\cf0\b0\par
Defined for all values of \b X\b0  and \b Y\b0  except negative integers and 0.\par
\par
Accuracy: Gives about 15 digits.\par
\par
\cf3\b Parameters\cf0\b0  \par
\b X\b0   First Value to process. \par
\b Y\b0   Second Value to process. \par
