\cf1 =====================================================\cf0\par
\cf2\b\par
IncompleteBeta\cf0\b0  Function \par
Returns the Incomplete Beta Ix(\b P, Q\b0 ), where 0 <= \b X\b0  <= 1 and \b P\b0  and\b  Q \b0 are positive.\par
\par
