\par
\cf3\b Description\cf0\b0\par
The Incomplete Beta function is the probability that a random variable from a Beta distribution having parameters P and Q will be less than or equal to X. Accuracy: Gives about 17 digits. Adapted From Collected Algorithms from CACM, Algorithm 179 - Incomplete Beta Function Ratios, Oliver G Ludwig.\par
