\cf1\f1 =====================================================\cf0\par
\par
\cf2\b BinomialCoeff\cf0\b0  Function \par
Returns the Binomial Coefficient of \b N\b0  by \b R\b0  as an Extended Float, thus allowing for large values.\par
\par
\cf3\b Declaration\cf0\b0\par
Function \b BinomialCoeff\b0 (const \b N, R\b0 : LongWord): Extended;\par
\par
\cf3\b Description\cf0\b0\par
Binomial Coefficient of \b N\b0  by\b  R \b0 is also known as the Combination of \b N\b0  by \b R\b0 , written as nCr, \par
which is the number of ways you can arrange \b R\b0  objects from \b N\b0  objects, when order is unimportant.\par
\par
Binomial Coefficients as\b  R \b0 goes from 0 to \b N\b0  are the coefficients of the terms when expanding (a + b)^\b N\b0 .\par
\par
\cf3\b Parameters\cf0\b0  \par
\b N\b0   Total Number of Items. \par
\b R\b0   Number of Chosen Items \par
\par
\cf1 =====================================================\cf0\par
\par
