Function \b Permutation\b0 (const \b N, R\b0 : LongWord): Extended;\par
\par
\cf3\b Description\cf0\b0\par
Permutation of \b N\b0  by \b R\b0  is the number of ways you can arrange \b R\b0  objects from \b N\b0  objects, when order is important.\par
\par
\cf3\b Parameters \cf0\b0\par
\b N\b0   Total Number of Items. \par
\b R\b0   Number of Chosen Items. \par
\cf1\f1 =====================================================\par
