\cf0\par
\pard\sb100\sa100\cf2\lang1033\b MilliSecondOfTheHour\cf0\b0  Routine Returns the number of milliseconds between a specified TDateTime value and the beginning of the same hour. \par
\cf3\b Syntax\cf0\b0  \par
function \b MilliSecondOfTheHour\b0 (const AValue: TDateTime): Cardinal; \par
\cf3\b Description\b0  \cf0\par
