\cf0\par
\pard\sb100\sa100\cf2\lang1033\b MilliSecondOfTheMinute\cf0\b0  Routine Returns the number of milliseconds between a specified TDateTime value and the beginning of the same minute. \par
\cf3\b Syntax\b0  \cf0\par
function \b MilliSecondOfTheMinute\b0 (const AValue: TDateTime): Cardinal; \par
\cf3\b Description\cf0\b0  \par
Call MilliSecondOfTheMinute to obtain the number of milliseconds between AValue and the start of the same minute on the same day. \line\pard\cf1\lang1049 =====================================================\par
\cf0\par
\pard\sb100\sa100\cf2\lang1033\b MilliSecondOfTheMonth\cf0\b0  Routine Returns the number of milliseconds between a specified TDateTime value and the beginning of the month. \par
\cf3\b Syntax\cf0\b0  \par
function \b MilliSecondOfTheMonth\b0 (const AValue: TDateTime): Cardinal; \par
\cf3\b Description\b0  \cf0\par
